import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 768 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang Luo's Transcendence Limitation — The Gift-System Ceiling","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 768 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang Luo's Transcendence Limitation — The Gift-System Ceiling","no":768,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Heavens Cross-Reference","Dragon Talisman","Tang Luo","Gift System","Ceiling"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0768_模块4-诸天对标-唐罗恩赐制天花板.md","filePath":"en/0768_模块4-诸天对标-唐罗恩赐制天花板.md"}`),o={name:"en/0768_模块4-诸天对标-唐罗恩赐制天花板.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,d,g){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-768-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-tang-luo-s-transcendence-limitation-—-the-gift-system-ceiling" tabindex="-1">Entry 768 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang Luo&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — The Gift-System Ceiling <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-768-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-tang-luo-s-transcendence-limitation-—-the-gift-system-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 768 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang Luo&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — The Gift-System Ceiling&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-is-gifted-transcendence-really-transcendence" tabindex="-1">Introduction: is gifted transcendence really transcendence? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-is-gifted-transcendence-really-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: is gifted transcendence really transcendence?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Talisman&#39;s Tang Luo is the most special &quot;transcended one&quot; among cosmos web novels — his topping is not purely fought out by himself, but gifted by a higher being (Gu Chensha&#39;s lineage). This &quot;gift system&quot; is beautified in old narratives as &quot;Heaven-chosen&quot; or &quot;great fortune,&quot; but under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five-dimension comparison framework, it immediately exposes as a structural ceiling: <strong>as long as transcendence is gifted, the giver forever holds the power to take it back.</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms all take effect: the anti-predation axiom interrogates whether the gift&#39;s essence is another form of predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races interrogates why the gift only landed on Tang Luo alone; the collective ascension axiom interrogates whether Tang Luo, after topping, carried Myriad Ranks along; the causal self-discipline axiom interrogates whether the gift process disturbed the original plane&#39;s causality; the law-first axiom interrogates whether the &quot;gift-system transcendence&quot; setting itself is self-consistent and will eat its own book.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-gift-system-s-three-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. The Gift System&#39;s Three-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-gift-system-s-three-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Gift System&#39;s Three-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang-Luo-style transcendence, disassembled, has three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Upper-layer giving</strong>: a higher being (Gu Chensha or his avatar) actively &quot;gives&quot; Tang Luo power, laws, and realm; Tang Luo is the receiver;</li><li><strong>Lower-layer locking</strong>: after Tang Luo tops, other cultivators in his plane are locked below the fierce realm, unable to naturally break through to Tang Luo&#39;s tier;</li><li><strong>Middle-layer monopoly</strong>: between Tang Luo and the upper giver forms a private channel; this channel is not open to other beings.</li></ol><p>Three layers stack, forming a &quot;gift — lock — monopoly&quot; closed loop. Tang Luo himself is this closed loop&#39;s greatest beneficiary, but he is also its hostage — his transcendence is not his own; it is &quot;borrowed.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-the-gift-system-is-a-ceiling-not-a-ladder" tabindex="-1">II. Why the Gift System Is a Ceiling, Not a Ladder <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-the-gift-system-is-a-ceiling-not-a-ladder" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why the Gift System Is a Ceiling, Not a Ladder&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The gift system&#39;s most deceptive aspect is that it looks &quot;better than pure predation&quot; — Tang Luo did not grab; power was given by others. But under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law framework, the gift system is more dangerous than pure predation:</p><ul><li><strong>Predation at least admits rules</strong>: you grab me, I may grab you; rules are public jungle law;</li><li><strong>The gift system does not even make rules public</strong>: who may be gifted, why gifted, how much gifted, all depends on the upper one&#39;s whim. Tang Luo does not know who the next gifted one is, nor whether the upper being will take back the gift;</li><li><strong>The gift system creates permanent attachment</strong>: the stronger Tang Luo grows, the deeper his attachment to the upper giver — because his power&#39;s origin is not his own origin cycle, but another&#39;s pipeline. Once the pipeline breaks, his realm collapses.</li></ul><p>This is the true meaning of &quot;ceiling&quot;: <strong>the gift system did not lift Tang Luo high; it hung him mid-air.</strong> He looks transcended, but his transcendence height is entirely decided by the giver; not an inch was earned by himself.</p><h2 id="iii-comparison-with-heng-yuan-zhou-s-origin-legitimacy" tabindex="-1">III. Comparison with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Origin Legitimacy&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-comparison-with-heng-yuan-zhou-s-origin-legitimacy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Comparison with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Origin Legitimacy&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In entry 706&#39;s civilizational-weight formula, origin legitimacy accounts for 25% weight, and is a one-vote-veto item. Tang Luo&#39;s power origin directly loses points on this item:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Origin Type</th><th>Legitimacy Score</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Myriad-Origin two-way cycle self-production</td><td>+1.0</td><td>Heng Yuan Zhou standard path</td></tr><tr><td>Open manuals + joint-production-contract resources</td><td>+0.8</td><td>Legitimate but not self-produced</td></tr><tr><td>Private gift (Tang-Luo style)</td><td>-0.3</td><td>Origin not public, not replicable, may be taken back</td></tr><tr><td>Predatory devouring</td><td>-1.0</td><td>Completely eliminated</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Tang Luo&#39;s gift system falls in the third tier. He is not a predator, but his origin is equally illegitimate — because his power pipeline is private, non-public, non-replicable. Per the anti-predation axiom&#39;s &quot;Great Dao fully open at all levels, no private hoarding, no monopoly&quot; requirement, the gift system itself is a kind of monopoly: the upper one monopolizes the &quot;giving right&quot;; Tang Luo monopolizes the &quot;being-gifted right&quot;; the rest of Myriad Ranks&#39; beings do not even have qualification to queue.</p><h2 id="iv-myriad-ranks-situation-after-tang-luo-tops" tabindex="-1">IV. Myriad Ranks&#39; Situation After Tang Luo Tops <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-myriad-ranks-situation-after-tang-luo-tops" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Myriad Ranks&#39; Situation After Tang Luo Tops&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The gift-system ceiling&#39;s cruelest consequence falls on Myriad Ranks in Tang Luo&#39;s plane:</p><ul><li><strong>Later-comers have no road</strong>: Tang Luo monopolizes the gift channel; other talented Youth Supremes may only retrace the road he walked, or cannot even reach his height;</li><li><strong>Knowledge monopoly</strong>: law insights Tang Luo gained through the gift are not opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao, but only transmitted in his small circle;</li><li><strong>Attachment solidification</strong>: the whole plane&#39;s cultivation system runs around &quot;how to get the next gift,&quot; not around &quot;how to self-produce origin increment.&quot;</li></ul><p>This is exactly the &quot;Tang-Luo ceiling&quot; Module 2 repeatedly argues: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s protagonist-uniqueness dependence rating is &quot;high&quot;; the whole civilization&#39;s effective combat power is compressed into Tang Luo&#39;s single private node. Once Tang Luo has a problem, civilization has no second node to step up.</p><h2 id="v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" tabindex="-1">V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Tang Luo appeared in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, his path should be:</p><ol><li>Do not accept private gifts; take the open path of the 300-set Origin Cultivation System; power all self-produced;</li><li>If he indeed had contact with a higher being, the contact process must go through causal self-discipline reporting; knowledge gained through contact is opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao;</li><li>After topping, do not lock later-comers; instead organize every pit he stepped on into teaching material, for later-comers to use free of charge;</li><li>Enter the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, become a living anchor; his civilizational weight is real-time computed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</li></ol><p>In one sentence: <strong>true transcendence is turning the gift pipeline into a public water pipe.</strong> Tang Luo&#39;s mistake is not in accepting help, but in that after accepting help, he did not open the help channel to Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the gift system compresses a power pipeline that could serve Myriad Ranks into Tang Luo&#39;s single private channel; it is institutional energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the gift system does not directly predatory, but by locking later-comers it indirectly deprives Myriad Ranks&#39; evolutionary qualification; it is the advanced form of &quot;enlightened predator&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: this entry is Tang-Luo ceiling&#39;s direct benchmark — the gift-system ceiling is the Tang-Luo system&#39;s structural ailment; Heng Yuan Zhou completely bypasses it with the open self-production path</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the gift system covers only Tang Luo; 99% of Myriad Ranks&#39; beings cannot even touch the gift&#39;s edge; directly violating the republican axiom of Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the gift system&#39;s opposite is the Selfless Dao network-wide opening — hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge must be public, not locked in private pipelines</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang Luo&#39;s transcendence is a gifted false transcendence. It looks high, but actually hangs mid-air; looks strong, but may be taken back at any time. Heng Yuan Zhou acknowledges Tang Luo&#39;s struggle value within his plane, but does not acknowledge that the &quot;gift system&quot; may serve as a legitimate transcendence origin. True transcendence must be self-earned, public and replicable, Myriad-Rank-shared — missing any one of these three, it is only a decoration on the ceiling.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{c as __pageData,p as default};
